function f(e){const t=Number(e)||0;return t>=1e8?`${(t/1e8).toFixed(1)}亿`:t>=1e4?`${(t/1e4).toFixed(1)}万`:String(t)}function s(e){const t=Math.max(0,Math.floor(Number(e)||0)),r=Math.floor(t/3600),n=Math.floor(t%3600/60),i=t%60,o=r?String(n).padStart(2,"0"):String(n),a=String(i).padStart(2,"0");return r?`${r}:${o}:${a}`:`${o}:${a}`}function u(e){const t=new Date(e);if(Number.isNaN(t.getTime()))return"";const r=n=>String(n).padStart(2,"0");return`${t.getFullYear()}-${r(t.getMonth()+1)}-${r(t.getDate())} ${r(t.getHours())}:${r(t.getMinutes())}`}function c(e){const t=new Date(e).getTime();if(Number.isNaN(t))return"";const r=Date.now()-t,n=6e4;return r<n?"刚刚":r<60*n?`${Math.floor(r/n)}分钟前`:r<1440*n?`${Math.floor(r/(60*n))}小时前`:r<720*60*n?`${Math.floor(r/(1440*n))}天前`:u(e).slice(0,10)}export{c as a,f as b,u as c,s as f};
